<Behavior #profiled-ctrl-flow apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #semantic-primitives (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC2>
      CtrlFlow SHALL expose semantic orchestration primitives rather than raw behavior-tree implementation nodes. The canonical grammar SHALL define Run, If, Require, Fallback, Retry, Timeout, Until, ForEach, Parallel, Race, CallFlow, and Return with explicit data, fault, cancellation, and lifecycle semantics.
      </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC2>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #authoring-boundary { name = "公开作者边界" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #reject-raw-behavior-tree (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC3>
              a CtrlFlow product definition contains public Sequence, Selector, or Condition
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC3>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC4>
              the canonical loader validates it
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC4>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC5>
              the definition SHALL be rejected as internal behavior-tree syntax
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC5>
            )>
            <Case #parallel-subdomain (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC6>
              a Parallel definition contains concurrent bodies
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC6>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC7>
              it is serialized
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC7>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC8>
              it SHALL own one Lanes child domain rather than reusing If Branches
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC8>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #profile-capabilities (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC9>
      Each public orchestration primitive SHALL declare product capability and lifecycle semantics. InstantCtrlFlow SHALL reject durable waiting and recovery behavior; WorkCtrlFlow and BPCtrlFlow SHALL own all facts needed to resume enabled durable primitives; BPCtrlFlow human parallelism SHALL remain owned by TaskGroup executionMode.
      </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WC9>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #capability-validation { name = "产品能力校验" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #instant-rejects-durable-target (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCA>
              an InstantCtrlFlow CallFlow targets a suspend-capable product
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCA>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCB>
              the definition is validated
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCB>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCC>
              validation SHALL reject the synchronous invocation
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCC>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #callable-flow-contract (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCD>
      InstantCtrlFlow, WorkCtrlFlow, and BPCtrlFlow SHALL each own exactly one FlowContract child domain whose id equals the root FQN and whose optional input/output code type references define the static callable boundary. CallFlow validation SHALL resolve target form, contract, and permitted invocation mode through a registry.
      </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCD>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #contract-resolution { name = "可调用契约" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #contract-id (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCE>
              a CtrlFlow FlowContract is declared
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCE>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCF>
              the loader validates its definition
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCF>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCG>
              its id SHALL equal the enclosing flow FQN
              </?01M0NJZ4N5ECVH7AVK1X6A8WCG>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
